# Fixture: an optional profession and a step behind `when skill`
# (tests/playtest.test.js). The Herbs step's goto is on a map the game has no
# frame for: a player who chose Herbalism takes the optional train at the
# abbey and is stuck there; one who did not never learns it and plays the
# guide through.
guide skill/northshire
title Skill Fixture
faction Alliance
race Human
levels 1-6
zone Elwynn Forest

step Northshire Abbey
  goto 48.2,42.0 "Northshire Abbey"

step Abbey garden
  train Herbalism optional
  goto 50.6,40.2 "Abbey garden"

step Herbs
  when skill Herbalism 1
  goto 50,50 map 9999 "Nowhere"
